+# <ppl_b> <ppl_q> <top> <kld> <p99> <floors>: one line "c_ppl c_top c_kld c_tail fixed_why adaptive_why END", cells
+# "value_(calibration_/_limit)" for the blocking policy, why = '-' or comma-separated reasons. Exit 3 on a non-finite
+# derived value. The caller checks the exit status and the shape of the line.
+gate() {
